  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Pardon me, excusez-moi (I'm sorry)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Yeah, I coulda made a better choice, I mean, what the fuck?",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'm sorry, I'm fucking sorry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm sorry, I'm sorry I don't see you more",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'm sorry that the four minutes where you see your son could feel like a chore",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Sis', I'm sorry I'm your kin",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Sorry we ain't close as we should've been",
          "rhyme": ")n",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Sorry to my old friends",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "The stories we coulda wrote if our egos didn't take the pen",
          "rhyme": "@n",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Sorry to the freaks I led on (Nah, for real, I'm sorry)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Who thought their life was gonna change 'cause I gave 'em head on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "But instead, I sped off, yeah, I know I'm dead wrong",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Sorry to the guys I had to hide (Ooh)",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Sorry to the girls I had to lie to",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Who ain't need to know if I was by the lake switchin' tides, too (Tides)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Anyway, I don't wanna talk (You and me, girl)",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Sorry if you gotta dig for info I don't wanna give",
          "rhyme": "iv",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "So you stalk, make a vid just to talk 'bout my private life 'cause you're weird (Uh)",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Got that good ish, yeah (But), that's none ya biz (But), that's none ya biz",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Give enough with my art, know your place",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "My personal space, y'all don't need to be a part",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "I'm sorry I don't wanna link and small talk over dinner",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I don't even drink, can't guilt trip me, I'm ice cold, roller rink",
          "rhyme": "ink",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Nigga-nigga-nigga, read the room",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Don't assume niggas is cool",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Stay in your pocket, this is pool",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Blah, blah, blah, blah 'bout trauma",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "You ain't special, everybody got problems, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Sorry I'm not empathetic  (Nah, I'm fuckin', woo)",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Sorry you think I'm pathetic",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Sorry I don't wanna bro down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Sorry I don't know your pronouns",
          "rhyme": "(",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "I don't mean no disrespect",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "But, damn, we just met, calm the fuck down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Oh, I'm out of touch and I'm a jerk?",
          "rhyme": "ERk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "A bank account could never match my worth (That nigga gettin' money, he a dick now)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Sorry, Mother Earth (I'm sorry)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Polluted air with chemicals and dirt",
          "rhyme": "9Rt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "These cars ain't gonna buy and drive themselves (I'm sorry)",
          "rhyme": "alv",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "What the hell you think I work for? (I'm sorry)",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Not to not explore and stay the same (I'm sorry)",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Sorry to the fans who say I changed, 'cause I did",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Sorry you don't know me on a personal level to pinpoint what it is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "I'm sorry to my ancestors (I'm sorry), I know I'm supposed to fight (You and me, girl)",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "But this ice shinin' brighter than a black man's plight, I'ma make it right",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "In the meantime, I'll give some advice while these blood diamonds gettin' cleaned off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Nigga, fuck the price, spend it then, then again, I can't save niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "I'm not Superman, but I could try",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "I'm sorry I'm pretentious (Sorry)",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Sorry that the talent, knowledge, passion isn't missin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Sorry when I talk my shit and I could back it up with confidence, it get you niggas trippin', man",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Fuck the numbers, fuck a hook",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "You put me on a stage and I'll show you the difference",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Let me see y'all hit a stage (No, y'all can't do it)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "Let me see y'all write a page (Y'all not gon' do it)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "Let me see you make a decision I made",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "And claim that I don't know about minimum wage or Section 8",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "Water in the ketchup bottle to stretch when niggas ate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "Gettin' pressed by niggas hoppin' gates",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "Thinkin' it's normal 'cause you ain't supposed to make it past eighteen or escape the Figure 8 cycle",
          "rhyme": "ikl",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "And I promise this is like a diet, I'ma make a way and I did, did",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "Feel good, work paid off, now we gon' celebrate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "But niggas claim you arrogant when they can't relate to moments of feelin' great",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "So they aim, duck-duck-duck 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "Shot right back, buck-buck-buck 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "Sorry, not sorry (Buck 'em, buck 'em)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "I got two words, fuck 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFFGHIIJKLMNOPQRSSTUVVWXYWZ[[\\]A^TY__`TaUbDcdeefF[[gT[[hhah",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDEFFFBGGABHBIIJBKKKIKBBILHIHIIMIAIIHIIAIBKCDKDIIIFIIBIIIHHBH"
    },
    {
